Rule 2 (if output tensor v_3 is provided, its shape must match input tensors v_1 and v_2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if v_3 ≠ v_3 then true else shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_3, 0) ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_3, 0)
